<title>USA: Sears says to co-guarantee unit's notes.</title>
<headline>Sears says to co-guarantee unit's notes.</headline>
<dateline>GREENVILLE, Del. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sears, Roebuck and Co said on Wednesday that Sears Roebuck Acceptance Corp has become a co-guarantor of the obligations of Orchard Supply Hardware Corp with respect to its 9-3/8 percent Senior Notes due 2002.</p>
<p>Orchard Supply Hardware Stores Corp, the parent company of Orchard Supply Hardware Corp and a wholly owned unit of Sears, is the other co-guarantor, the company said.</p>
</text>
